    "owner_does": "Counts as an admin. The only one who can export, legally hold, destroy or restore a kept copy, and the only one who can hand the role to another member or name one successor (who has no powers until they hold the role). Every kept copy is sealed to the owner's key card, and the successor's. Nobody can ban, mute, kick, demote or erase the owner.",
